q: title: Katy Perry and Justin Trudeau confirmed relationship by October 31?, description: This market will resolve to "Yes" if Katy Perry and Justin Trudeau are confirmed to be in a romantic relationship by October 31, 2025, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to "No".

Confirmation must come directly from Katy Perry or Justin Trudeau or their official representative(s), and may come through public statements, social media posts, etc. market_id: 570342 res_data: p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to No, p2 to Yes, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x157Ce2d672854c848c9b79C49a8Cc6cc89176a49 as described by https://polygonscan.com/tx/0xa14f01b115c4913624fc3f508f960f4dea252758e73c28f5f07f8e19d7bca066 should be considered.,initializer:91430cad2d3975766499717fa0d66a78d814e5c5,ooRequester:157ce2d672854c848c9b79c49a8cc6cc89176a49